  "reasoning": "The defendant operated two hot pot restaurants and sold large quantities of meat that was past its expiration date, continuing the sales despite knowing the meat was unsafe. This constitutes the crime of producing and/or selling food that does not meet food safety standards, as defined in Chinese criminal law. No other crimes are indicated in the facts.\n\nTherefore the appropriate charge is the offense of producing and selling food that does not meet safety standards.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]生产、销售不符合食品安全标准的食品<eoa>"
